3. vLLM  (Apache License 2.0)
   https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm  (version 0.24.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Runtime dependency; no vLLM source is copied. plugin/mimo_v2_neuron/model/mimo_v2/fp8_linear.py and
