4. XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD remote code
   https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD  (revision b12f5573350bb1704513fcf119fca48e498b0423)
   Copyright 2026 Xiaomi Corporation; Copyright 2026 The HuggingFace Inc. team.
   modeling_mimo_v2.py / configuration_mimo_v2.py carry an Apache License 2.0 header;
   the model repository card declares the MIT License.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  patches/modeling_mimo_v2.py.patch, patches/configuration_mimo_v2.py.patch
      Modifications to the upstream remote code for transformers 5.15 (API changes only: inputs_embeds
      keyword, removed cache_position argument, empty vision_config / audio_config not set as attributes).
      The patches contain context lines of the upstream files. The upstream files themselves are NOT
      redistributed in this repository: scripts/prepare_hf_reference.sh copies them from the user's own
      download of the pinned revision, verifies their SHA-256, and applies the patches into reference/
      (git-ignored). The patched files keep the original copyright and license header and gain a header
      block that lists each modification.
  plugin/mimo_v2_neuron/model/mimo_v2/audio_encoder.py
      ports AudioTokenizerEncoder, the residual VQ and MiMoAudioEncoder from modeling_mimo_v2.py,
      rewritten with plain tensor ops.
  plugin/mimo_v2_neuron/model/mimo_v2/vision_encoder.py, routing.py, attention_torch.py
      follow the maths of MiMoVisionTransformer, MiMoV2MoEGate and eager_attention_forward in
      modeling_mimo_v2.py (independent implementations).
  Model weights are not included and are subject to the model repository's license.

